<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Our story — Onewish</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/style.css"></head><body><header class="nav"><a class="brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/">onewish<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><nav><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/menu">Menu</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/contact">Contact</a></nav></header><main class="plain-page"><p class="eyebrow">A TABLE FOR EVERYONE</p><h1>Little moments.<br><em>Made better.</em></h1><p>Onewish began with a simple thought: the best parts of a day often happen around a table. We make the coffee carefully, cook the food fresh, and leave room for one more.</p><p>Come by for a slow morning, a quick lunch or a sweet treat to take with you. Good things take time, and we think they are better shared.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/menu">Find your favourite ↗</a></main></body></html>
